  "welcome_to": "歡迎使用 Proton Wallet",
  "welcome_to_content_1": "This is a self-custodial Bitcoin wallet, meaning any BTC you buy or receive will be fully controlled by you. Not even Proton can seize your assets.\n\nTo avoid losing assets due to forgetting your password or other access issues, back up your Proton recovery phrase and wallet seed phrase.\n\nWe have created two BTC accounts for you. A primary account, and a second account for receiving Bitcoin via Email at ",
